/-! ### The smoothed `d = 3` Green density -/

/-- The density of the Green-smoothed `d = 3` wave kernel: `∫ p_η(z - y) G_s(dy)`. -/
def green3s (η s : ℝ) (z : Rd 3) : ℝ≥0∞ :=
